ow 1 reads 'Deuteron gap (the formal derivation)', a token substitution where a script name stood — the same corruption class already recorded in this chapter's sidecars (cl3-zeta5-geometric-realization.qa.json, borromean-bloch-group-element.qa.json) and visible in ~10 sibling files; note that row 2 of the same table keeps its name ('q-variants (q-variant-partition-sum)'), which is what makes row 1's parenthetical read as a hole. It survives to the earliest committed version of the file, so it cannot be recovered from history; the producer named in the .ts computation field is computations/proton_residual_rootcause.py. Table 5's other cell, 'within 0.1% of each other', is off by the same margin as DEFECT 1: classical 2.5 vs q-analogue 2.4972905 differ by 0.108%.","history":2},{"id":"trap-performed-warmth","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:v03","history":2},{"id":"trap-rhetorical-pivot","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:v03","history":2},{"id":"trap-superlative","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:v03","history":2},{"id":"trap-thesis-restatement","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:v03","history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:v03","history":2},{"id":"uses-editorial-hygiene","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["lean","md","ts"],"at":"2026-11-24","reviewer":"script","by":"pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","history":1},{"id":"uses-formal-coverage","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","chang